# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own Supabase project's values.
# Find both of these in your Supabase project: Settings → API.
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is the "anon" / "publishable" key — it is safe to
# ship in the frontend bundle because Row Level Security (see
# supabase/schema.sql) controls what it can actually read or write.
#
# NEVER put the "service_role" key here or anywhere in frontend code — it
# bypasses Row Level Security entirely.

